				<div class="post-709 post hentry category-virtual-pc">
			<h2 id="post-709"><a href="http://blog.cromwellhaus.com/index.php/2008/06/sysprep-your-virtual-pc-images/" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to SysPrep Your Virtual PC Images">SysPrep Your Virtual PC Images</a></h2>
